cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "obrasgovpy: Access the Brazilian federal government's ObrasGov open data API from Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python client for the open data API of ObrasGov.br, the Brazilian federal
  government's platform for public infrastructure projects: projects, physical
  execution, contracts, budget commitments, geometries, feasibility studies
  and project status histories. Returns pandas DataFrames with typed date
  columns and nested relationships preserved, with defensive pagination,
  throttling and retries. Python sibling of the R package obrasgovr.
